Yes.
是的。

809
00:33:01.700 --> 00:33:07.180
This Bob was played by John Capadish, who is putting on gloves that are way too small
这个鲍勃由约翰·卡帕迪什饰演，他戴的手套对他来说

810
00:33:07.180 --> 00:33:07.580
for him.
太小了。

