00:33:07.960 --> 00:33:09.060
I watched it several times.
我看了好几遍。

812
00:33:09.060 --> 00:33:10.080
This is what you noticed.
这就是你注意到的地方。

813
00:33:10.240 --> 00:33:12.740
This is what you had to rewatch was the glove moment.
这就是你不得不重看的原因，那个戴手套的瞬间。

814
00:33:12.940 --> 00:33:13.400
Watch it.
看着。

815
00:33:13.620 --> 00:33:14.000
Watch it.
看着。

816
00:33:14.060 --> 00:33:16.180
He's never going to get those gloves on his hands.
他永远也戴不上那副手套。

817
00:33:16.300 --> 00:33:17.380
I'm going to say this with love.
我是带着爱说这句话的。

