要实现这种时机配合超级困难。

832
00:33:46.480 --> 00:33:50.720
They only had one bus to blow up, so the timing had to be perfect.
他们只有一辆公交车可以炸，所以时机必须完美。

833
00:33:51.120 --> 00:33:56.320
Also, the bus that they blow up is not the bus that you see driving by moments before
而且，被炸掉的那辆公交车并不是你在爆炸前几秒钟

834
00:33:56.320 --> 00:33:57.400
it blows up.
看到驶过的那辆。

835
00:33:57.760 --> 00:34:00.700
They did what is called a Texas switch.
他们用了所谓的“德州切换”手法。

836
00:34:01.880 --> 00:34:07.480
Jan said the real bus goes past Keanu and it takes a left turn, but you don't see it because
简说真正的公交车从基努身边经过并向左转，但你没看到，因为

837
00:34:07.480 --> 00:34:08.140
you're on Keanu.
镜头在基努身上。

838
00:34:08.140 --> 00:34:15.240
And then when the camera sweeps back around, their shell of a bus that had like a mannequin
然后当摄像机扫回来时，那辆公交车外壳里有个假人

839
00:34:15.240 --> 00:34:20.280
for a driver and it was being pulled by a truck, that was their bomb bus, that's the
当司机，而且是被一辆卡车拖着的，那是他们的爆炸车，那是

