00:34:25.700 --> 00:34:27.440
So you have to see the front of a real bus.
所以你必须看到真公交车的前部。

842
00:34:27.560 --> 00:34:29.960
It turns left and then it reveals bomb bus.
它向左转，然后露出了爆炸车。

843
00:34:30.080 --> 00:34:30.660
Fakie bus.
假公交车。

844
00:34:30.840 --> 00:34:30.960
Okay.
好吧。

845
00:34:31.280 --> 00:34:31.840
Guess what?
你猜怎么着？

846
00:34:32.040 --> 00:34:32.240
What?
什么？

