00:34:45.160 --> 00:34:52.580
A woman got past the production and ran on to bomb bus thinking she had missed her bus.
有个女人绕过了剧组，冲上了那辆炸弹巴士，以为自己错过了公交车。

854
00:34:52.740 --> 00:34:53.840
That is terrifying.
那太可怕了。

