00:35:11.040 --> 00:35:24.480
Well, if you go to 28 minutes and one seconds, when there is a high camera angle shot of the bus, you can see a red van with a giant, like, I don't know, what do you call it?
如果你看到28分01秒，当镜头从高处俯拍巴士时，你能看到一辆红色货车，后面拖着个巨大的，我不知道，那叫什么？

