866
00:35:26.360 --> 00:35:27.360
Pulling the bus.
拖着巴士。

867
00:35:27.640 --> 00:35:28.940
You can see the tow car?
你能看到牵引车？

868
00:35:29.080 --> 00:35:29.700
All of it.
全都能看到。

869
00:35:29.960 --> 00:35:32.280
You can see all of it at 28 minutes, one seconds.
在28分01秒，你什么都能看清。

