00:35:44.440 --> 00:35:51.020
For some reason, Jack feels compelled to answer the ringing payphone in the middle of this bombed bus.
出于某种原因，杰克觉得他必须接听这辆炸弹巴士上响起的公用电话。

878
00:35:51.160 --> 00:35:57.080
I just feel like if I saw something blow up and then all of a sudden the payphone started ringing, I would think I better answer it.
