00:36:23.080 --> 00:36:24.860
I would just pick it up and hang it up and then call 911.
我只会拿起听筒再挂掉，然后拨打911。

891
00:36:25.240 --> 00:36:26.360
I wouldn't be like, hello?
我才不会说，喂？

892
