It's running downtown from Venice.
它正从威尼斯开往市中心。

924
00:37:46.210 --> 00:37:49.250
It's at the corner of Ocean Park.
它现在在海洋公园路口。

925
00:37:49.730 --> 00:37:50.090
Hey.
嘿。

926
00:37:51.530 --> 00:37:52.390
And he's off.
他出发了。

927
00:37:52.470 --> 00:37:53.150
He's off.
他出发了。

928
00:37:53.310 --> 00:37:57.050
He hops in his truck at 30 minutes, 55 seconds, you guys.
他在30分55秒时跳上了他的卡车，各位。

929
00:37:57.230 --> 00:37:59.110
He left his coffee on top of the Jeep.
他把咖啡忘在吉普车顶上了。

930
00:37:59.990 --> 00:38:00.710
Oh, wow.
噢，哇。

931
00:38:00.810 --> 00:38:02.570
He drives away with the coffee on top of his car.
他就那样带着车顶上的咖啡开车走了。

932
00:38:02.570 --> 00:38:04.070
I thought this was very realistic.
我觉得这非常写实。

933
00:38:04.690 --> 00:38:07.130
We are now going to cut to bus 2525.
我们现在要切到2525号公交车。

934
00:38:07.190 --> 00:38:08.550
It's making its stops.
它正在沿途停靠。

935
00:38:08.730 --> 00:38:09.770
But guess who missed the bus?
但猜猜谁错过了这辆车？

936
00:38:10.310 --> 00:38:10.590
Annie.
安妮。

937
00:38:10.790 --> 00:38:11.070
Annie.
安妮。

938
00:38:11.250 --> 00:38:12.190
She's running after.
她在后面追。

