她在冲司机萨姆大喊。

940
00:38:14.450 --> 00:38:16.130
Sam, played by Hawthorne James.
萨姆，由霍桑·詹姆斯饰演。

941
00:38:16.350 --> 00:38:18.030
By the way, is she running with a cigarette?
顺便问一下，她跑的时候是不是还拿着烟？

942
00:38:18.390 --> 00:38:19.150
And a coffee.
还有咖啡。

943
00:38:19.430 --> 00:38:19.670
Yeah.
是的。

944
00:38:20.090 --> 00:38:22.850
Before she gets on the bus, because, you know, Sam slows down for her.
在她上车之前，因为，你知道，萨姆为她减速了。

945
00:38:23.010 --> 00:38:23.130
Yeah.
是的。

946
00:38:23.210 --> 00:38:24.370
He says, put out the butt.
他说，把烟灭了。

947
00:38:24.490 --> 00:38:25.230
And she goes, okay.
